I would make the reservation for five. One of us has to stay with Emma.
那這樣我會只訂五個人的位子 我們其中一個要留下來照顧艾□

10
00:00:32,160 --> 00:00:34,250
- Which one of us should go to dinner? - Rachel!
-我們該誰去晚餐呢？ -瑞秋！

11
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:40,690
Actually, I was thinking maybe both of us could go.
事實上，我想或許我們兩個都可以去

12
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:42,341
Oh. Yeah.
哦，真好！

13
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:46,500
Thanks. I'll put a lot of extra thought into your gift.
謝謝，我會多用點心準備你的禮物

14
