All right, so great, we can all go now.
好了，太棒了，我們全部都可以去

15
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:52,750
That is fun! Hey! You know what?
真棒！嘿！你們知道嗎？

16
00:00:52,910 --> 00:00:56,610
We all haven't been together, the six of us, in such a long time.
我們六個人已經很久沒有這樣在一起了

17
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:59,010
What are you talking about? We're together now.
你在說什麼呢？ 我們現在就在一起啊？

18
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:01,810
Mon? Chandler's not here.
摩妮卡，錢德並不在這裡

19
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:06,960
Oh, dear God.
喔，老天

20
00:01:08,601 --> 00:01:10,626
The One With Phoebe's Birthday Dinner
本集播出：菲比的生日晚餐

00:01:11,601 --> 00:01:12,626
rianystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:01:54,314 --> 00:01:55,941
（土爾沙）

22
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:59,280
Hello. It's nice to see our team together for the first time.
大家好，很高興第一次我們全員到齊

23
