All right, look. I don't smoke anymore.
好了，聽著，我戒煙了

39
00:02:57,440 --> 00:03:00,670
But if the rest of you want to light up, go ahead, it's fine.
如果你們其他人也想抽 請便，沒關係的

40
00:03:04,150 --> 00:03:06,480
So, you all smoke, then?
原來你們全部都抽煙

