Wait, does this mean you'll be late?
等一下，這表示你們會遲到嗎？

58
00:04:17,190 --> 00:04:19,090
We haven't seen each other in over a week.
我們已經超過一個星期沒有見面了

59
00:04:19,250 --> 00:04:21,090
We'll probably be the first ones there.
我們可能會是第一個到的

60
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:24,060
Okay. See you there. Happy humping.
好了，待會見，祝你們搞的愉快

61
