Actually, in Oklahoma smoking's legal in offices with fewer than 15 people.
事實上，在奧克拉荷馬 在少於十五人的辦公室抽煙是合法的

65
00:04:43,710 --> 00:04:45,510
Oh, you smoked.
喔，是你抽的！

66
