No. I just happen to know a lot of trivia about smoking in different states.
不是，我只是剛好知道 不同州的抽煙規定

67
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:55,210
For example, in Hawaii, cigarettes are called lei-lana-lukus.
例如，在夏威夷 香煙叫做雷拉納路卡斯

68
