我好想你

78
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:48,430
- You want to join me in the bedroom? - No, thanks, I'm good.
-想要跟我進房間嗎？ -不，謝了，不用

79
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:53,310
Okay. So you want to play it that way, do you?
好的，你想要這樣玩，是嗎？

80
