Well, you know what, actually, I just got off a plane..
嗯，你知道嗎？事實上 我才剛下飛機…

81
00:05:56,450 --> 00:05:58,720
so I'm feeling gross. I should take a shower.
覺得有點髒 我應該先洗個澡

82
