You only hear Monica's side of that. Okay, that little fatso was a terror!
你都只聽她說的話 那個肥妹是個恐怖份子！

105
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:27,270
- I just don't think I can do it. - Know what? You can and you should.
-我只是不認為我辦得到 -你知道嗎？你應該、也辦得到

106
