Really, it will be good for you.
真的，這對你是有幫助的

107
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:31,080
In fact, you know what?
事實上，你知道嗎？

108
00:07:31,250 --> 00:07:33,910
Go ahead to the restaurant, and I will wait for my mom..
你先去餐廳，我留下來等我媽…

109
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:37,780
and then I'll meet you there. No, no, really, you should go. Go out.
然後我再過去找你們 真的，你應該過去，出去

110
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:44,480
Really, the world is your oyster. Kick up your heels. Paint the town red!
真的，這世界是你的 甩開高跟鞋，揮灑出自己的顏色！

111
00:07:45,330 --> 00:07:49,730
- You need to learn some new slang. - I'm serious. Come on, you should go.
-你是該學些新的廣告詞 -我是說真的，走吧，你該走了

112
00:07:49,930 --> 00:07:52,760
Here. No, just go.
來，去吧

113
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:54,900
- Well.. - No, no! You know what?
-那… -不，不！你知道嗎？

114
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:59,060
You're not getting back in there! The baby's fine. Now, scram!
你別想要進去！寶寶沒事的！ 現在快走吧！

115
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,000
Yeah, hit the bricks!
是啊，邁開步伐走吧！

116
00:08:03,740 --> 00:08:06,010
Tell your story walking!
什麼都免驚，向前行！

117
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:10,210
I was just going to say that I left my keys.
我只是要說，我忘記帶鑰匙了

118
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:17,090
Holy moley, are we in a pickle now!
老天啊，這下我們慘了！

119
